    "body": "**Hands-on check on macOS, release build of this branch (Tool library page).** All behaved as intended:\n\n- Export library: writes the file.\n- Import into a new document: the tools arrive.\n- Importing the same file again skips the tools that are already there.\n- A malformed JSON file is refused by name: \"tool library not imported: not a tool library (bad JSON: expected value at line 1 column 1)\". Nothing is applied.\n- Cmd+Z removes the imported tools, and Cmd+Y restores them.\n\nWith the merge and gate noted above (`tool_library` 11/11, only reds that also fail on main), this is ready.\n\n**Follow-up:** the MCP tools for this (`export_tool_library` / `import_tool_library`) are filed as #355.\n",
