    "body": "Hands-on finding (macOS, build b63f1d7): **Export library… doesn't add `.camtools` when the user types a name without it.** The save panel suggests `tools.camtools`, but macOS doesn't enforce an unknown extension, so a typed name saves with no suffix. Import still read it, by contents. M3 is fixing it on this branch: append `.camtools` when the chosen path has no extension, pinned by a test. Other sessions: please fetch before pushing here.",
