    "body": "Resolved the conflict with upstream #442 in merge `47bbae5d` (upstream/main merged into this branch):\n\n- `crates/ui/tests/snapshots/egui_tool_editor.png`: the golden can't be merged as text, so I took main's version and re-rendered it from this tree (`UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1 cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib tool_editor_snapshot`). The new golden shows both sides: this PR's **Export library…** / **Import library…** buttons on the Tool pane, and #442's **Theme…** ribbon entry. `tool_editor_snapshot` passes without `UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS`.\n\nGate (`scripts/gate.sh quick upstream/main`, app + ui suites): all 11 `tool_library` pinning tests and `tool_editor_snapshot` pass. The only reds are the known ones that also fail on main: the GPU headless tests (`headless_run_succeeds`, `headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`, `egui_headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`) and `setup_stock_source::a_new_block_after_a_flip…` (#415, fixed by #420).\n\nThe branch merges cleanly with main. Flagging ready again.\n",
